Q: How to add an interactive notification badge to my web page? A: <p>To answer your question precisely:</p>

<p><strong>HTML</strong></p>

<pre><code>&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#news" class="nav"&gt;News&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="badge"&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</code></pre>

<p><strong>Javascript (requires jQuery)</strong></p>

<pre><code>$('.nav').on('click', function(){
    $('.badge').hide()
})
</code></pre>

<p>It will stay hidden alright. :)</p>
